  "history": [],
  "facts": [
    "The Super Dragon is a troop available in the Clan Capital, available when the Super Dragon Barracks is constructed (this requires a level 2 District Hall in the Dragon Cliffs district, and hence Capital Hall level 7).",
    "The Super Dragon is the Super version of the Dragon that shoots bursts of flames similar to the Roaster in the Builder Base. His flame bursts hit 10 times, each doing splash damage over a sizable area of effect (about 1-tile radius)."
  ],
